+## Claude Code Bedrock Launchers
+
+Three Claude Code launchers are provided under `scripts/launchers/` for running Claude Code via AWS Bedrock:
+
+| Script | Model |
+|--------|-------|
+| `aims_claude_opus46.sh` | Claude Opus 4.6 |
+| `aims_claude_sonnet46.sh` | Claude Sonnet 4.6 |
+| `aims_claude_haiku45.sh` | Claude Haiku 4.5 |
+
+Each launcher automatically checks for a valid AWS SSO session and triggers `aws sso login` if the token is expired — no credentials are stored in files. Run from the workspace root:
+
+```bash
+bash scripts/launchers/aims_claude_opus46.sh
+```
+
+Verify all launchers before use:
+
+```bash
+bash scripts/launchers/verify_ai_cli_launchers.sh
+```
+
